Package: ivmediate
Type: Package
Title: Causal Mediation Analysis with a Single Instrument
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andreas", "Ferrara", email = "a.ferrara@pitt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Robert", "Gold", role = "aut"),
    person("Stephan", "Heblich", role = "aut"),
    person("Rodrigo", "Pinto", role = "aut"))
Description: Estimates causal mediation effects with a single instrument for the
    treatment, following Ferrara, Gold, Heblich and Pinto (2026): the total, direct,
    mediator and indirect effects by two-stage least squares, with classical, robust,
    clustered or spatial (Conley) standard errors, absorbed one- and two-way fixed
    effects and weights. Reports Olea-Pflueger first-stage diagnostics,
    Anderson-Rubin confidence sets, kappa- and R-squared-based sensitivity analyses,
    an optional post-double-selection LASSO for the controls and bootstrap inference.
